### Netcup SCP API — Firewall Policies
# CRUD operations for user-level firewall policies.

### List All Firewall Policies
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/firewall-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Search Policies by Name
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/firewall-policies?q=REPLACE_WITH_SEARCH_TERM
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List Policies with Pagination
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/firewall-policies?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Single Policy
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/firewall-policies/{{policy_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create Policy (example: allow SSH from specific IP)
# Rule fields per OpenAPI spec:
# - direction: INGRESS | EGRESS
# - protocol: TCP | UDP | ICMP | ICMPv6
# - action: ACCEPT | DROP
# - sources: array of IP/CIDR strings (can be multiple)
# - destinations: array of IP/CIDR strings
# - destinationPorts: port string (e.g., "22", "80")
# - sourcePorts: port string (nullable)
# - description: optional text
POST {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/firewall-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ssh-temp-test",
  "rules": [
    {
      "direction": "INGRESS",
      "protocol": "TCP",
      "action": "ACCEPT",
      "sources": ["203.0.113.1/32"],
      "destinations": [],
      "destinationPorts": "22",
      "sourcePorts": null,
      "description": "Allow SSH from test IP"
    }
  ]
}

### Update Policy
PUT {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/firewall-policies/{{policy_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ssh-temp-test-updated",
  "rules": [
    {
      "direction": "INGRESS",
      "protocol": "TCP",
      "action": "ACCEPT",
      "sources": ["203.0.113.1/32", "198.51.100.0/24"],
      "destinations": [],
      "destinationPorts": "22",
      "sourcePorts": null,
      "description": "Allow SSH from multiple sources"
    }
  ]
}

### Delete Policy
DELETE {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/firewall-policies/{{policy_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
